{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/extras/logo-st.png?t=1745342783\" /><strong></strong><br><strong>Can a toy car become the hero of a video game? One night, its owner vanished without a trace. Left alone in the quiet room, this little car sets out on a journey - to find the boy...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the player, you\u2019ll take control of the toy car, solving clever puzzles, navigating tricky challenges, and finding ways to escape the boy\u2019s home. But the journey doesn\u2019t stop there - the car ventures beyond the house into the streets, parks, and many other exciting locations, all while chasing clues about the boy's disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/extras/steamgif1_SMALLER.gif?t=1745342783\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The big world outside is full of dangers for a small toy car. Falling from great heights, fire, and water are just some of the perils you\u2019ll face. And there are enemies too - dogs, robotic vacuums, and other toys that stand in your way. But don\u2019t worry! You can push, move, and interact with almost anything, thanks to the game\u2019s dynamic physics system, letting you find creative solutions to every obstacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/extras/steamgif2-smaller.gif?t=1745342783\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This thrilling adventure, packed with heartwarming and emotional moments, is a game the whole family can enjoy. Uncover the mystery of the boy\u2019s disappearance - maybe he needs your help more than you think!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Add it to your Wishlist today and don\u2019t miss the release!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3273260?t=1745342783","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745342783","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/294c36b88bbd1e54107414712ab0a5a0a6c0323b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745342783","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/294c36b88bbd1e54107414712ab0a5a0a6c0323b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745342783","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/extras/logo-st.png?t=1745342783\" /><strong></strong><br><strong>Can a toy car become the hero of a video game? One night, its owner vanished without a trace. Left alone in the quiet room, this little car sets out on a journey - to find the boy...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the player, you\u2019ll take control of the toy car, solving clever puzzles, navigating tricky challenges, and finding ways to escape the boy\u2019s home. But the journey doesn\u2019t stop there - the car ventures beyond the house into the streets, parks, and many other exciting locations, all while chasing clues about the boy's disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/extras/steamgif1_SMALLER.gif?t=1745342783\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The big world outside is full of dangers for a small toy car. Falling from great heights, fire, and water are just some of the perils you\u2019ll face. And there are enemies too - dogs, robotic vacuums, and other toys that stand in your way. But don\u2019t worry! You can push, move, and interact with almost anything, thanks to the game\u2019s dynamic physics system, letting you find creative solutions to every obstacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/extras/steamgif2-smaller.gif?t=1745342783\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This thrilling adventure, packed with heartwarming and emotional moments, is a game the whole family can enjoy. Uncover the mystery of the boy\u2019s disappearance - maybe he needs your help more than you think!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Add it to your Wishlist today and don\u2019t miss the release!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Gest.LT"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273260/477711c69f252d3fa290efebe6681250d9afb894/header.jpg?t=1745342783","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257117919,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117919/movie480.mp4?t=1744278160","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117919/movie_max.mp4?t=1744278160"},"name":"Lost Host - Early Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117919/7c90a01ebd750803fc19c46759c6ca09381da938/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744278160","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117919/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744278160","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117919/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744278160"}}],"name":"Lost Host","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_